    excerpt: 'Ubuntu — "I am because we are" — is not a motivational slogan. It is one of the most rigorous ethical frameworks in human history, and its implications for our epidemic of loneliness, broken institutions, and fractured communities are more urgent than ever.',
    author: 'JOJO Penwood',
    date: '2026-06-02',
