    title: 'Why Courtroom Drama and Legal Thrillers Are So Addictive',
    excerpt: 'The courtroom is a theatre where two narratives compete before an audience tasked with judging not truth — rarely fully available — but the more compelling story. This is why legal thrillers and courtroom drama books grip readers across every culture and generation.',
    author: 'JOJO Penwood',
